The WanGP checkpoint stores the transformer in BF16 with the modules the source keeps in FP32 at inference
(time embedder, modulation tables, the affine cross-attention norm) in FP32, under WanGP's Wan module names.

The world memory's depth model is ViGeo1.1:
https://github.com/aigc3d/ViGeo (code, commit 78100ce), Apache-2.0
https://huggingface.co/pkqbajng/ViGeo1.1 (weights)
