are responsible for meeting it. The WanGP file keeps the trunk and decoder projections in FP16 and the rest in
FP32, without the heads EVOKE does not read (ray, normal, mask, confidence, camera).

The Wan2.1 VAE and the UMT5-XXL text encoder are WanGP's existing Wan2.1 components (Apache-2.0).
